l":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121569485?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole","html_url":"https://github.com/TrueJole","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrueJole/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T11:09:36Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T19:38:51Z","body":"The keys seem to be hardcoded in (was scene_debugger.cpp, now runtime_node_select.cpp). The shortcuts work fine when using the freelook cam in the editor. But I agree that it should use the same settings.\n```c++\nif (camera_freelook) {\n\t\tTransform3D transform = _get_cursor_transform();\n\t\tVector3 forward = transform.basis.xform(Vector3(0, 0, -1));\n\t\tconst Vector3 right = transform.basis.xform(Vector3(1, 0, 0));\n\t\tVector3 up = transform.basis.xform(Vector3(0, 1, 0));\n\n\t\tVector3 direction;\n\n\t\tInput *input = Input::get_singleton();\n\t\tbool was_input_disabled = input->is_input_disabled();\n\t\tif (was_input_disabled) {\n\t\t\tinput->set_disable_input(false);\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::A)) {\n\t\t\tdirection -= right;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::D)) {\n\t\t\tdirection += right;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::W)) {\n\t\t\tdirection += forward;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::S)) {\n\t\t\tdirection -= forward;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::E)) {\n\t\t\tdirection += up;\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (input->is_physical_key_pressed(Key::Q)) {\n\t\t\tdirection -= up;\n\t\t}\n``` \nI can try to create a PR, but I don't have much experience.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3864217563/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865157962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115982#issuecomment-3865157962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115982","id":3865157962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mYaFK","user":{"login":"Nemrosin","id":188278463,"node_id":"U_kgDOCzjmvw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188278463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin","html_url":"https://github.com/Nemrosin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nemrosin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T19:39:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T19:39:00Z","body":"Going to look into this as my first issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865157962/reactions"